  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You're bad for me, I clearly get it"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I don't see how something good could come from loving you"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "The death of me must be your mission"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "'Cause with every hug and kiss, you're snatching every bit of strength"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "That I'm gon' need to fight off the inevitable"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "And it's a heart-breakin' situation I'm up in, but I can't control"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You're just like poison"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Slowly moving through my system"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Breaking all of my defenses with time"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "You're just like poison"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And I just don't get it"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "How can something so deadly feel so right?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "post-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I'm not sure of what to do (Ooh)"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "It's a catch-22 (Ooh)"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "'Cause the cure is found in you (Ooh)"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I don't want it, but I do (Ooh)"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You're just like poison (Ooh)"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "My affliction, I'm addicted, I can't lie (Ooh, ooh)"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Kiss me one more time before I die (Ooh)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You ain't right, take me high"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Then that high, it subsides"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And my body flat-lines"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Then you come to revive"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Wait, wait, wait, I'm alive"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But how long will it last?"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Will it all come crashing down?"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "How many doses am I needing now?"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "What's the prognosis, will you be around?"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Or am I just another victim of an assassin that broke my heart down?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_5",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
