    {
      "section_id": "section_7",
      "type": "bridge",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "It's just not my body (No)"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "It's my mind"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You don't know how many times I told myself this can't do"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And that I don't need you (No, I don't need you, no)"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "It's so unfair"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "That I find myself right back in your care"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And what's good is that when you're not always there (There, there)"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "You're no good for my health, my health"
        }
      ]
    },
